{
  "_readme": [
    "设计节点 style 的**可渲染键清单 + 别名表**（唯一事实源）。",
    "",
    "为什么需要它：ops 的 set_style 接受任意 style 键（后端不校验），而渲染层 styleToCss",
    "只认固定的一批键——模型写 boxShadow / borderRadius / backgroundColor 这类近义写法时",
    "会被计成\"已改动 N 处\"，画布却完全不动（实测踩过：7 处改动、视觉零变化）。",
    "",
    "本文件解决两件事：",
    "1. aliases：把常见的近义写法归一成可渲染的规范键；",
    "2. renderable：规范键清单——不在其中的键，前端在变更清单里标为\"渲染层不支持\"并在回执说明。",
    "",
    "硬规则（契约测试锁）：aliases 的**每个值都必须出现在 renderable 里**。",
    "指向不可渲染键的别名等于\"归一了也渲染不出来\"，属于该删的条目。",
    "",
    "消费方：frontend/src/design/styleKeys.ts（镜像）+ backend/app/services/generate.py（注入提示词）。",
    "后端 ops 不读它：ops 仍接受任意键（那是数据层），渲染层兼容由别名归一兜住。"
  ],
  "renderable": [
    "layout",
    "gap",
    "color",
    "background",
    "radius",
    "width",
    "height",
    "spacing",
    "padding",
    "backgroundImage",
    "animation",
    "shadow",
    "transform",
    "justify",
    "alignItems",
    "align",
    "fontWeight",
    "fontSize",
    "flex",
    "border",
    "textDecoration",
    "backdropFilter",
    "filter",
    "opacity"
  ],
  "aliases": {
    "boxShadow": "shadow",
    "box-shadow": "shadow",
    "borderRadius": "radius",
    "border-radius": "radius",
    "backgroundColor": "background",
    "background-color": "background",
    "bgColor": "background",
    "textColor": "color",
    "font-size": "fontSize",
    "font-weight": "fontWeight",
    "justify-content": "justify",
    "align-items": "alignItems",
    "text-align": "align",
    "text-decoration": "textDecoration",
    "backdrop-filter": "backdropFilter"
  },
  "labels": {
    "layout": "布局（free/row/column/grid）",
    "gap": "间距",
    "color": "文字色（令牌名或色值）",
    "background": "背景色（令牌名或色值）",
    "radius": "圆角（数字，px）",
    "width": "宽度",
    "height": "高度",
